-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"v3-menu-toggle\">MENU <span>☰</span></button></div></header><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"v4-red-symbol\" src=\"/assets/aroz-logo.png\"/><dialog aria-label=\"Main menu\" id=\"v3-menu\"><div class=\"v3-menu-top\"><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">START A PROJECT</a><button aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"v3-close\">MENU ×</button></div><nav><a href=\"/webdesign/index.html\">Web Design</a><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a><a href=\"/projekte/index.html\">Projects</a><a href=\"/agentur/index.html\">Agency</a><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a></nav><a class=\"v3-about-pill\" href=\"/agentur/index.html\">✦ The story of AROZ</a><div class=\"v3-menu-contact\"><span>PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Let's talk ↗</a><p>Schwelm · NRW</p></div><div class=\"v3-menu-services\"><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a></div></dialog>\n<div aria-label=\"Breadcrumb navigation\" class=\"r6-breadcrumb r6-wrap\"><a href=\"../../index.html\">Homepage</a><span>/</span><a href=\"../index.html\">AI SEO</a><span>/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Structured Content.</span></div>\n<main id=\"main\"><section aria-labelledby=\"r6-title\" class=\"r6-hero\"><div class=\"r6-hero-copy\"><p class=\"r6-kicker\">AR<span>O</span>Z <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> AI SEO <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> 01 / Understanding</p><h1 id=\"r6-title\"><span class=\"r6-subject\">Structured Content.</span>Knowledge needs a readable structure.</h1><p class=\"r6-lead\">Good information needs a form people can understand.</p><div class=\"r6-hero-actions\"><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Discuss your content structure <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"r6-text-link\" href=\"#gedanke\">More about our approach <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div><div class=\"r6-meta\"><span>CONTEXT / EVIDENCE / UNDERSTANDING</span><span>Schwelm / NRW</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-hero-art\"><span class=\"r6-art-index\">03 / STRUCTURE</span><div aria-label=\"Illustration of our approach\" class=\"concept-art concept-structure\"><div class=\"concept-title\">Semantic structure</div><div class=\"semantic-list\"><div><span>H1</span><b>One clear main topic</b></div><div><span>H2</span><b>The relevant question</b></div><div><span>P</span><b>An understandable answer</b></div><div><span>REF</span><b>A helpful reference ↗</b></div></div><div class=\"concept-caption\">Simplified structure example</div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-thinking\" id=\"gedanke\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-thinking-grid\"><div class=\"r6-section-side\"><p class=\"r6-small-label\">01 / Understanding</p><div class=\"r6-stamp\">AI SEO<span> / Strategy</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-thinking-main\"><h2 class=\"r6-oversized\">How do you find a statement again without reading the whole page?</h2><div class=\"r6-thinking-bottom\"><p>Structure is more than headings. Sections, examples, data, definitions and references should guide readers logically through a topic. We develop pages that work as a whole while answering individual questions clearly. The structure always serves the user journey.</p><blockquote>Headings alone do not create structure.</blockquote></div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-focus r6-focus-ai\" id=\"schwerpunkte\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><header class=\"r6-focus-heading\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">02 / Establishing context</span><h2>Structure helps people and machines.</h2><p>Each section has a clear purpose. Semantics and structured data must agree with the visible statements.</p></header><ol class=\"r6-focus-list\"><li><span>01</span><strong>Clear heading levels</strong></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Useful sections and FAQs</strong></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Markup that matches the content</strong></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-how\" id=\"ablauf\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-how-grid\"><div class=\"r6-how-intro\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">03 / Ensuring quality</span><h2>Organise knowledge.<br/><em>Make it clear.</em></h2><p>We connect precise headings, useful paragraphs and suitable structured data, only where they are accurate.</p></div><ol class=\"r6-steps\"><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">01</span><div><h3>Organise content</h3><p>Separate the main topic, subtopics and recurring questions.</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">02</span><div><h3>Refine passages</h3><p>Give each section a recognisable purpose and clear statements.</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">03</span><div><h3>Align the technology</h3><p>Keep schema markup, HTML semantics and the actual visible content consistent.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-result\" id=\"ergebnis\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-result-inner\"><div><span class=\"r6-small-label\">04 / Recognising quality</span><h2>Clear passages, beyond markup alone.</h2></div><div><p>A clear, logically documented content structure that can grow over time.</p><div aria-label=\"Useful details for starting a project\" class=\"r7-brief\"><p class=\"r7-brief-label\">So we can give you a specific answer</p><ul><li>An example page with complex information</li><li>Your audience's important questions</li></ul><p class=\"r7-brief-note\">No account access or passwords required.</p></div><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Clarify your structural needs <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-next\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><div class=\"r6-next-title\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">EXPLORE FURTHER / RELATED TOPICS</span><h2>Where structure meets content.</h2></div><div class=\"r6-links\"><a href=\"../entitaeten-seo/index.html\"><span>Entity SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../seo/seo-fuer-websites/index.html\"><span>Website SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../copywriting/website-texte/index.html\"><span>Website Content.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-end\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-end-inner\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">AROZ / CONTACT</span><h2>Knowledge should help.<br/><em>It needs more than markup.</em></h2><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Request a content review <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"r6-footer\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-footer-inner\"><div><img alt=\"AROZ\" height=\"52\" src=\"../../assets/aroz-logo.png\" width=\"112\"/><p>Strategy, web design, SEO and communication.<br/>From Schwelm, for businesses with ambition.</p></div><div class=\"r6-footer-actions\"><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"../../impressum/index.html\">Legal Notice (review draft)</a><a href=\"../../datenschutz/index.html\">Privacy Policy (review draft)</a></div></div></footer>\n\n\n","headScripts":[]}
